{"id":"baron-of-vernot","name":"Baron of Vernot","type":"character","aliases":["the Baron","the baron"],"description":"A noble of Luneau who tortured Vivien and was killed by her.","pages":4,"first_seen":"2018-09-05","last_seen":"2018-09-07","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Vivien Reid","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Vivien Reid\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"vivien-reid-e1","era":{"date":"2017-09-29","era":"xln","label":"Ixalan"},"summary":"On Ixalan, Vivien intervenes against the Baron of Vernot, is captured and tortured, escapes, kills the Baron, and frees and enlarges the menagerie, destroying Luneau.","participants":["vivien-reid","baron-of-vernot","luneau"],"location":null,"importance":"major","page":"wiki/vivien-reid","order":3250,"story_date":"","storyline":"","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":7,"quote":"Vivien killed the Baron by firing the spirit of the monstrosaur at him.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid#:~:text=Vivien%20killed%20the%20Baron,the%20monstrosaur%20at%20him.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Vivien Reid","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Vivien_Reid#:~:text=Vivien%20killed%20the%20Baron,the%20monstrosaur%20at%20him.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Vivien Reid\", section \"On Ixalan\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e0","era":null,"summary":"Vivien wakes, bloodied and suspended in manacles, as the Baron of Vernot tells her he has taken her Arkbow.","participants":["vivien-reid","baron-of-vernot"],"location":"luneau","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","order":668,"story_date":"2018-09-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":4,"quote":"We took your bow.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=We%20took%20your%20bow.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=We%20took%20your%20bow.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e1","era":null,"summary":"The baron describes his failed attempts to use the Arkbow and questions what Vivien is, speculating she is a Planeswalker.","participants":["baron-of-vernot","vivien-reid","the-arkbow"],"location":"luneau","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","order":668,"story_date":"2018-09-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":10,"quote":"I wonder if you are a Planeswalker.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=I%20wonder%20if%20you%20are%20a%20Planeswalker.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=I%20wonder%20if%20you%20are%20a%20Planeswalker.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e2","era":null,"summary":"Vivien demands the Arkbow back; the baron refuses and presses her on how it works, and she mentions Skalla.","participants":["vivien-reid","baron-of-vernot","the-arkbow"],"location":"luneau","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","order":668,"story_date":"2018-09-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":21,"quote":"Return the Arkbow.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=Return%20the%20Arkbow.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=Return%20the%20Arkbow.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e3","era":null,"summary":"The baron tortures Vivien repeatedly with boiling-blood magic and blades, and nuns heal her each time; Vivien resists, having already been scarred by Bolas's destruction of Skalla.","participants":["baron-of-vernot","vivien-reid","the-nuns","nicol-bolas"],"location":"luneau","importance":"major","page":"stories/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","order":668,"story_date":"2018-09-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":27,"quote":"Each time he asked his questions, the baron's magic reached out, found the blood coursing through Vivien's body, and brought it to boil.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=Each%20time%20he%20asked,brought%20it%20to%20boil.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=Each%20time%20he%20asked,brought%20it%20to%20boil.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e7","era":null,"summary":"A guard fetches Vivien, saying the baron has something to ask her, and she accepts rather than endure more stillness.","participants":["vivien-reid","baron-of-vernot"],"location":"luneau","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","order":668,"story_date":"2018-09-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":51,"quote":"Death, at that moment, appealed more than the continued ennui.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=Death%2C%20at%20that%20moment%2C,than%20the%20continued%20ennui.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=Death%2C%20at%20that%20moment%2C,than%20the%20continued%20ennui.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e8","era":null,"summary":"Vivien is brought to a ballroom where the baron vivisects a living monstrosaur before King Lucard and his courtiers.","participants":["vivien-reid","baron-of-vernot","king-lucard","monstrosaur","the-nuns"],"location":"luneau","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","order":668,"story_date":"2018-09-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":55,"quote":"He was, Vivien realized with a dazed start, not performing an autopsy, but a vivisection.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=He%20was%2C%20Vivien%20realized,autopsy%2C%20but%20a%20vivisection.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=He%20was%2C%20Vivien%20realized,autopsy%2C%20but%20a%20vivisection.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e9","era":null,"summary":"The baron reveals he has deduced Skalla is dead and Vivien is its last living relic, and offers her glories and a queen's place if she teaches him to use the Arkbow.","participants":["baron-of-vernot","vivien-reid","skalla","the-arkbow"],"location":"luneau","importance":"major","page":"stories/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","order":668,"story_date":"2018-09-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":66,"quote":"Teach me how to make use of the weapon and we will garland you with glories, ensure that you are never with an unfulfilled desire.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=Teach%20me%20how%20to,with%20an%20unfulfilled%20desire.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=Teach%20me%20how%20to,with%20an%20unfulfilled%20desire.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e10","era":null,"summary":"Vivien feigns capitulation, agreeing to show the baron the Arkbow's mechanism but insisting she needs the weapon and that only she can perform the ritual.","participants":["vivien-reid","baron-of-vernot","the-arkbow"],"location":"luneau","importance":"major","page":"stories/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","order":668,"story_date":"2018-09-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":77,"quote":"You can try all you want, but it won't work unless I'm performing the ritual.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=You%20can%20try%20all,I%27m%20performing%20the%20ritual.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=You%20can%20try%20all,I%27m%20performing%20the%20ritual.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05-e11","era":null,"summary":"Vivien needles the baron until his composure cracks, declares she does not fear him but he fears her, and signals King Lucard, whose lady-in-waiting begins to bring a drink.","participants":["vivien-reid","baron-of-vernot","king-lucard"],"location":"luneau","importance":"major","page":"stories/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","order":668,"story_date":"2018-09-05","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":89,"quote":"But I think I scare you.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=But%20I%20think%20I%20scare%20you.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 2","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-2-2018-09-05#:~:text=But%20I%20think%20I%20scare%20you.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 2\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07-e1","era":null,"summary":"The baron's minions assemble a containment contraption around the dying monstrosaur and the nuns conjure a barrier; Vivien steps inside.","participants":["baron-of-vernot","vivien-reid","the-nuns","monstrosaur"],"location":"luneau","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","order":669,"story_date":"2018-09-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":3,"quote":"More of the nuns were called to the room, and humming a couplet of chords, they conjured a shimmering barrier.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=More%20of%20the%20nuns,conjured%20a%20shimmering%20barrier.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 3","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=More%20of%20the%20nuns,conjured%20a%20shimmering%20barrier.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 3\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07-e2","era":null,"summary":"Vivien demands anesthetics for the monstrosaur, and the nuns numb it into a deep sleep at the baron's order.","participants":["vivien-reid","baron-of-vernot","the-nuns","monstrosaur"],"location":"luneau","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","order":669,"story_date":"2018-09-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":12,"quote":"The nuns complied.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=The%20nuns%20complied.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 3","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=The%20nuns%20complied.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 3\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07-e4","era":null,"summary":"The baron makes a guard try the Arkbow; it bursts his body, proving it obeys only Vivien, and the baron refuses to accept it.","participants":["baron-of-vernot","vivien-reid","the-arkbow"],"location":"luneau","importance":"major","page":"stories/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","order":669,"story_date":"2018-09-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":29,"quote":"A minute spasm of those meaty digits, and his body burst outward.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=A%20minute%20spasm%20of,his%20body%20burst%20outward.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 3","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=A%20minute%20spasm%20of,his%20body%20burst%20outward.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 3\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07-e7","era":null,"summary":"The monstrosaur bites the Baron of Vernot in half, killing him.","participants":["monstrosaur","baron-of-vernot"],"location":"luneau","importance":"major","page":"stories/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","order":669,"story_date":"2018-09-07","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":54,"quote":"the two halves of what was once the Baron of Vernot fell quietly, messily to the ground","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=the%20two%20halves%20of,messily%20to%20the%20ground","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unbowed, Part 3","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Cassandra Khaw"],"date":"2018-09-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unbowed-part-3-2018-09-07#:~:text=the%20two%20halves%20of,messily%20to%20the%20ground","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unbowed, Part 3\" by Cassandra Khaw. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Sep 2018."}},{"id":"luneau-e3","era":{"date":"2019-07-12","era":"m20","label":"Core Set 2020"},"summary":"Vivien is captured and tortured by the Baron of Vernot, who has stolen her Arkbow; she refuses to reveal its secrets.","participants":["vivien-reid","baron-of-vernot","the-arkbow"],"location":"luneau","importance":"major","page":"wiki/luneau","order":2246,"story_date":"","storyline":"Lost Caverns of Ixalan","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":7,"quote":"The Baron had stolen Vivien's Arkbow","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Luneau#:~:text=The%20Baron%20had%20stolen%20Vivien%27s%20Arkbow","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Luneau","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Luneau","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Luneau#:~:text=The%20Baron%20had%20stolen%20Vivien%27s%20Arkbow","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Luneau\", section \"Notable locations\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"luneau-e4","era":{"date":"2019-07-12","era":"m20","label":"Core Set 2020"},"summary":"The Baron moves Vivien to a gilded prison where she remains in magical stasis, relivin